{
  "schema": "vcad-orderable-parts/1",
  "version": "1",
  "checked": "2026-10-20",
  "notes": [
    "Curated ORDERABLE electronic parts: real manufacturer part numbers with",
    "package -> vcad footprint mapping, key parameters, datasheet, and the LCSC",
    "part number as verified against LCSC / JLCPCB public listings on `checked`.",
    "This is the sourcing sibling of the generative passive catalog and the",
    "jellybean pinout database: it answers 'what exactly do I order, and from",
    "where', not 'what are the pins'. Stock and price are NEVER stored here —",
    "they go stale in days; `check_part_stock` fetches them live (with this",
    "file as the offline fallback for identity and LCSC mapping).",
    "verification.status: verified = MPN and LCSC# confirmed on a vendor page;",
    "corrected = the source BOM's MPN or LCSC# was wrong, `bom_mpn` / `bom_lcsc`",
    "keep the original; flagged = could not be confirmed orderable — see note.",
    "Seeded from the rose limbic board BOM (mini/limbic). Bundled into",
    "@vcad/mcp at build time by scripts/gen-orderable-catalog.mjs."
  ],
